      "id": "1976764453166465024",
      "title": "Birds Don't Fly Like Planes. Neither Does AI.",
      "preview_text": "Your laptop can now run a model as capable as nearly anything in the cloud. I swapped Qwen3.8-27B into my agent & it works brilliantly. This bird flies differently than a plane.\nThis little Qwen model",
      "cover_media": {
        "id": "QXBpTWVkaWE6DAAFCgABHQBSy3QaEAAKAAIAAAAAAJmktAAA",
        "media_id": "2089761260879613952",
